      "text": "\u2713 catalog parsing + routing cards\n\u2713 Nebius OpenAI-compatible client\n\u2713 optional Tavily synthesis grounding\n\u2713 FAISS normalized vector store\n\u2713 intent split + vector vote + Top-3 rerank\n\u2713 FastAPI /chat, /agents, /health\n\u2713 shadow logs + correction script",
      "originalText": "\u2713 catalog parsing + routing cards\n\u2713 Nebius OpenAI-compatible client\n\u2713 optional Tavily synthesis grounding\n\u2713 FAISS normalized vector store\n\u2713 intent split + vector vote + Top-3 rerank\n\u2713 FastAPI /chat, /agents, /health\n\u2713 shadow logs + correction script",
